## 10. Server-Side Request Forgery

### Current Status

No SSRF risk is present in the current code because it does not make outbound HTTP requests based on user input.

### Future Guidance

If adding endpoints that fetch URLs, validate and restrict destinations.

Avoid:

```js
app.get('/fetch', async (req, res) => {
  const response = await fetch(req.query.url);
  res.send(await response.text());
});
```

Use allowlists instead.

